### 1. 员工登录
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "123456"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("token", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 2. 新增员工（先跑上面登录，会自动带上 token）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/employee
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "name": "张三",
  "phone": "13800138000",
  "sex": "1",
  "idNumber": "110101199001011234"
}

### 3. 员工分页查询
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/page?page=1&pageSize=10
token: {{token}}

### 4. 按姓名模糊查询
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/page?page=1&pageSize=10&name=张
token: {{token}}

### 5. 禁用员工（把 id 换成分页里看到的员工 id，勿禁用 admin）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/status/0?id=2
token: {{token}}

### 6. 启用员工
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/status/1?id=2
token: {{token}}

### 7. 按 id 查询员工（编辑回显）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/employee/2
token: {{token}}

### 8. 修改员工
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/employee
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "id": 2,
  "username": "zhangsan",
  "name": "张三丰",
  "phone": "13900139000",
  "sex": "1",
  "idNumber": "110101199001011234"
}

### ========== 分类管理 ==========

### 9. 新增分类（type: 1菜品分类 2套餐分类）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/category
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "type": 1,
  "name": "热菜",
  "sort": 1
}

### 10. 分类分页
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/category/page?page=1&pageSize=10
token: {{token}}

### 11. 分类列表（下拉用，只返回启用的）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/category/list?type=1
token: {{token}}

### 12. 禁用分类
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/category/status/0?id=1
token: {{token}}

### 13. 启用分类
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/category/status/1?id=1
token: {{token}}

### 14. 修改分类
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/category
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "type": 1,
  "name": "招牌热菜",
  "sort": 1
}

### 15. 删除分类
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/category?id=1
token: {{token}}

### ========== 菜品管理 ==========

### 16. 新增菜品（categoryId 换成已有分类 id，image 可先空或任意 URL）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/dish
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "name": "宫保鸡丁",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "price": 28.00,
  "image": "",
  "description": "经典川菜"
}

### 17. 菜品分页
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/dish/page?page=1&pageSize=10
token: {{token}}

### 18. 菜品分页（按名称/分类/状态筛选）
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/dish/page?page=1&pageSize=10&name=宫保&categoryId=1&status=1
token: {{token}}

### 19. 停售菜品（把 id 换成分页里的菜品 id）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/dish/status/0?id=1
token: {{token}}

### 20. 起售菜品
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/dish/status/1?id=1
token: {{token}}

### 21. 按 id 查询菜品
GET http://localhost:8080/admin/dish/1
token: {{token}}

### 22. 修改菜品
PUT http://localhost:8080/admin/dish
Content-Type: application/json
token: {{token}}

{
  "id": 1,
  "name": "宫保鸡丁（微辣）",
  "categoryId": 1,
  "price": 32.00,
  "image": "",
  "description": "经典川菜，花生脆香"
}

### 23. 删除菜品（需先停售）
DELETE http://localhost:8080/admin/dish?id=1
token: {{token}}

### 24. 图片上传（form-data，字段名 file；未配置 OSS 时存本地 uploads）
POST http://localhost:8080/admin/common/upload
token: {{token}}
Content-Type: multipart/form-data; boundary=WebAppBoundary

--WebAppBoundary
Content-Disposition: form-data; name="file"; filename="test.png"

< ./test.png
--WebAppBoundary--

### ========== 用户端 ==========

### 25. 用户登录（简化：直接传 openid）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/user/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "openid": "demo_openid_001"
}

> {%
    client.global.set("userToken", response.body.data.token);
%}

### 26. 用户端分类列表
GET http://localhost:8080/user/category/list?type=1
authentication: {{userToken}}

### 27. 用户端菜品列表（走 Redis 缓存，categoryId 换成真实分类 id）
GET http://localhost:8080/user/dish/list?categoryId=1
authentication: {{userToken}}

### 28. 新增收货地址
POST http://localhost:8080/user/addressBook
Content-Type: application/json
authentication: {{userToken}}

{
  "consignee": "李四",
  "sex": "1",
  "phone": "13900001111",
  "provinceName": "广东省",
  "cityName": "深圳市",
  "districtName": "南山区",
  "detail": "科技园南路 1 号",
  "label": "公司"
}

### 29. 地址列表
GET http://localhost:8080/user/addressBook/list
authentication: {{userToken}}

### 30. 设为默认地址（把 id 换成地址 id）
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/addressBook/default
Content-Type: application/json
authentication: {{userToken}}

{
  "id": 1
}

### 31. 加入购物车（dishId 换成真实菜品 id）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/shoppingCart/add
Content-Type: application/json
authentication: {{userToken}}

{
  "dishId": 1,
  "dishFlavor": "微辣"
}

### 32. 查看购物车
GET http://localhost:8080/user/shoppingCart/list
authentication: {{userToken}}

### 33. 提交订单（addressBookId 换成真实地址 id）
POST http://localhost:8080/user/order/submit
Content-Type: application/json
authentication: {{userToken}}

{
  "addressBookId": 1,
  "payMethod": 1,
  "remark": "少放辣",
  "packAmount": 1,
  "tablewareNumber": 2,
  "tablewareStatus": 1
}

### 34. 模拟支付（把 id 换成订单 id）
PUT http://localhost:8080/user/order/payment/1
authentication: {{userToken}}
